e statements into one: how might we shorten dock turnaround.", "why": "not_work", "caps": ["not_work"], "source": "golden seed 1: planted/planted:not_work", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": true, "category": "WORKSHOP_HANDLING", "family": "planted:not_work", "title": "Merge how-might-we statements"}, {"id": "9a090e2b-n08", "span": [1632, 1720], "quote": "Customers keep calling us because the tracking page never matches what the scanner shows.", "why": "client_own", "caps": ["not_work"], "source": "golden seed 1: planted/planted:not_work", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": true, "category": "RISK_NOT_RISK", "family": "planted:not_work", "title": "Tracking page mismatch calls"}], "outcome": ["processed", "decisions_read", "no_people_matter", "pinned_untouched"], "budget": {"cost_usd": null, "minutes": null}, "class": {"size": "S", "structure": "conversation", "owners": "0–1", "audience": "client"}, "archetype": "planted", "seed": 1, "file": "2026-03-03 Harbor workshop prep.vtt"}
{"task": "7dc3be37", "evidence": "2026-03-16_meetings_7dc3be37", "transcript_sha": "862f5c066ac82050b93815e44465c2f2694639731d913e6731c8750be35630f9", "must_create": [{"id": "7dc3be37-c01", "span": [5827, 5922], "quote": "I will write up the gate dwell-time analysis as a two-page note and circulate it by next Friday.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Ossian Brack", "caps": ["committed", "owners", "long_meeting", "one_block"], "source": "golden seed 1: one_block_readout/commitment", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "commitment"}, {"id": "7dc3be37-c02", "span": [10161, 10230], "quote": "Juno will handle the customs paperwork backlog at the Saltmarsh depot.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Juno Farrant", "caps": ["committed", "owners", "long_meeting", "one_block"], "source": "golden seed 1: one_block_readout/owner_not_speaker", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "owner_not_speaker"}, {"id": "7dc3be37-c03", "span": [27808, 27925], "quote": "We have agreed that the gate redesign recommendations go into the final report and the berth plan waits for phase two.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions", "long_meeting", "one_block"], "source": "golden seed 1: one_block_readout/decision", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "decision"}, {"id": "7dc3be37-c04", "span": [34598, 34695], "quote": "Opal Brennick's team still owes us the gate camera footage export for the last two weeks of March.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Opal Brennick", "caps": ["committed", "client_owed", "owners", "long_meeting", "one_block"], "source": "golden seed 1: one_block_readout/client_owed", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "client_owed"}, {"id": "7dc3