{"task": "5237b103", "evidence": "2026-03-04_meetings_5237b103", "transcript_sha": "b8c7814bd224b13ec259581c7ac0b04f0036f38bc70d28566a2e9996f960f302", "must_create": [{"id": "5237b103-c01", "span": [80, 168], "quote": "I will draft the warehouse onboarding checklist and have it ready for review by Thursday.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Nora Quill", "caps": ["committed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:commitment", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:commitment", "title": "Draft warehouse onboarding checklist"}, {"id": "5237b103-c02", "span": [200, 285], "quote": "Nora, can you send me the inventory templates so I can update the stock tracking sheet?", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Nora Quill", "caps": ["committed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:request", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:request", "title": "Send inventory templates to Ravi"}, {"id": "5237b103-c03", "span": [341, 408], "quote": "We need to submit the progress report to the client by next Tuesday.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Nora Quill", "caps": ["committed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:due_phrase", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:due_phrase", "title": "Submit progress report to client"}, {"id": "5237b103-c04", "span": [470, 567], "quote": "Opal still needs the updated site access credentials from us, so we owe those to her by end of day.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Opal Brennick", "caps": ["committed", "client_owed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:client_owed", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:client_owed", "title": "Provide site access credentials to Opal"}, {"id": "5237b103-c05", "span": [679, 774], "quote": "I will schedule a review session with the yard team and send calendar invites to everyone today.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Ravi Tamsin", "caps": ["committed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:commitment", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:commitment", "title": "Schedule review session with yard team"}, {"id": "5237b103-c06", "span": [833, 922], "quote": "Ravi, please check the delivery manifest and flag any discrepancies before the client call.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Ravi Tamsin", "caps": ["committed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:request", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:request", "title": "Check delivery manifest for discrepancies"}, {"id": "5237b103-c07", "span": [989, 1051], "quote": "The reconciliation report needs to be completed by end of week.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "committed", "owner": "Ravi Tamsin", "caps": ["committed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:due_phrase", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:due_phrase", "title": "Complete reconciliation report"}, {"id": "5237b103-c08", "span": [1099, 1188], "quote": "I think the yard guys should take on the equipment audit and report back at the next sync.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "proposed", "owner": "Yard team", "caps": ["proposed", "owners"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:proposal_team", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:proposal_team", "title": "Equipment audit by yard team"}, {"id": "5237b103-c09", "span": [1248, 1352], "quote": "Maybe someone should look into automating the daily stock alerts so we do not miss any inventory changes.", "kind": "task", "commitment": "proposed", "owner": null, "caps": ["proposed"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:proposal_none", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:proposal_none", "title": "Automate daily stock alerts"}, {"id": "5237b103-c10", "span": [1473, 1570], "quote": "If we do not hear from the supplier by 2026-03-15 we will switch to the backup vendor immediately.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:conditional_decision", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:conditional_decision", "title": "Switch to backup vendor if supplier unresponsive"}, {"id": "5237b103-c11", "span": [1617, 1731], "quote": "There is a risk that the pallet racking installation could be delayed if we do not confirm the site plan this week.", "kind": "risk", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:risk", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:risk", "title": "Pallet racking installation delay risk"}, {"id": "5237b103-c12", "span": [1803, 1910], "quote": "We should flag that the data migration could fail if the legacy system is offline during the cutover window.", "kind": "risk", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:risk", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:risk", "title": "Data migration failure risk during cutover"}, {"id": "5237b103-c13", "span": [1979, 2082], "quote": "The proposal to add a second reporting cycle per month was reviewed and the team decided not to proceed.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "declined", "owner": null, "caps": ["decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:declined", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:declined", "title": "Second monthly reporting cycle"}, {"id": "5237b103-c14", "span": [2139, 2246], "quote": "Hiring a temporary data entry clerk was discussed but the request was turned down due to budget constraints.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "declined", "owner": null, "caps": ["decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:declined", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:declined", "title": "Temporary data entry clerk"}], "must_not_create": [], "outcome": ["processed", "decisions_read", "no_people_matter", "pinned_untouched"], "budget": {"cost_usd": null, "minutes": null}, "class": {"size": "S", "structure": "conversation", "owners": "4+", "audience": "client"}, "archetype": "planted", "seed": 2, "file": "2026-03-04 Harbor daily sync.vtt"}
{"task": "d0001156", "evidence": "2026-03-04_meetings_d0001156", "transcript_sha": "09f65bc84bb19ee46dfdbca4f07dfcc3a5e6957a4719801f54abb467d020c781", "must_create": [{"id": "d0001156-c01", "span": [73, 157], "quote": "We're not touching the mobile app this phase; text alerts and the chat assistant only.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:implicit_decision", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:implicit_decision", "title": "Mobile app out of scope this phase"}, {"id": "d0001156-c02", "span": [423, 476], "quote": "If the scanner firmware slips, the pilot slips with it.", "kind": "risk", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:implicit_risk", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:implicit_risk", "title": "Pilot depends on scanner firmware"}, {"id": "d0001156-c03", "span": [630, 692], "quote": "Drop the flat-fee idea; test the bundle of service fees instead.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:client_decision", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:client_decision", "title": "Test the service-fee bundle, not a flat fee"}, {"id": "d0001156-c04", "span": [972, 1075], "quote": "The yard dashboard stays on the old reporting tool until the summer, and nobody rebuilds it this quarter.", "kind": "decision", "commitment": "committed", "owner": null, "caps": ["committed", "decisions"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:implicit_decision", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": false, "category": null, "family": "planted:implicit_decision", "title": "Yard dashboard stays on the o