e statements into one: how might we shorten dock turnaround.", "why": "not_work", "caps": ["not_work"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:not_work", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": true, "category": "WORKSHOP_HANDLING", "family": "planted:not_work", "title": "Merge how-might-we statements"}, {"id": "28bbf21f-n08", "span": [1633, 1721], "quote": "Customers keep calling us because the tracking page never matches what the scanner shows.", "why": "client_own", "caps": ["not_work"], "source": "golden seed 2: planted/planted:not_work", "status": "draft", "difficulty": null, "pending_ruling": true, "category": "RISK_NOT_RISK", "family": "planted:not_work", "title": "Tracking page mismatch calls"}], "outcome": ["processed", "decisions_read", "no_people_matter", "pinned_untouched"], "budget": {"cost_usd": null, "minutes": null}, "class": {"size": "S", "structure": "conversation", "owners": "0–1", "audience": "client"}, "archetype": "planted", "seed": 2, "file": "2026-03-04 Harbor workshop prep.vtt"}
